# Raphael, Most Attitude: "you may play a card exiled with Raphael" is one card. Turn 1 exiles two cards with him, the
# Bolt and a Mountain. Turn 3 he attacks and the Bolt is cast from exile; the permission is then used up, so the Mountain
# can't be played from exile in the second main phase, though Bot1 has not made a land drop (CR 607.2a, 611.2c).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Raphael, Most Attitude
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Mountain
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Raphael, Most Attitude.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
? Exile.Count = 1
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
? Exile.Count = 2
